1
00:01:38,090 --> 00:01:43,970
[Small Town Remedy]

2
00:01:44,170 --> 00:01:46,850
[Episode 16]

3
00:01:46,560 --> 00:01:48,200
"Yearning"

4
00:01:48,950 --> 00:01:50,710
by Li Bai from the Tang Dynasty.

5
00:01:51,310 --> 00:01:54,400
Fresh autumn breeze, bright autumn moon.

6
00:01:54,950 --> 00:01:57,810
Fallen leaves gather
and scatter around the trees;

7
00:01:58,039 --> 00:02:01,100
Cold-stricken crows soon fall asleep
and wake as soon.

8
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:04,280
When will we meet again?
I long for you so much.

9
00:02:04,840 --> 00:02:07,480
-This moment, this night, is so agonizing.
-What brings you two here?

10
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:10,190
Um, do you have security cameras here?

11
00:02:10,590 --> 00:02:11,630
The hospital footage shows

12
00:02:11,630 --> 00:02:13,360
that he left at 6:42.

13
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:15,310
Your camera faces the hospital entrance.

14
00:02:15,310 --> 00:02:17,190
Let's start looking from 6:42 onward,

15
00:02:17,190 --> 00:02:18,000
right?

16
00:02:18,150 --> 00:02:19,280
See whether he left alone

17
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:20,470
or was picked up,

18
00:02:20,470 --> 00:02:21,150
and whether he walked

19
00:02:21,150 --> 00:02:22,280
or got into a car.

20
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:23,210
Alright.

21
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:25,280
6:42, right?

22
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:27,520
Let's start from here then.

23
00:02:27,550 --> 00:02:31,050
[Camera 01] [Camera 02]

24
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:30,520
Drag the timeline forward a little

25
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:31,650
and speed it up a bit.

26
00:02:33,630 --> 00:02:37,900
[Prosperous Dynasty]

27
00:02:34,310 --> 00:02:35,120
Is that him?

28
00:02:35,470 --> 00:02:35,910
Hey, that one, that one.

29
00:02:35,910 --> 00:02:36,630
That's him.

30
00:02:38,190 --> 00:02:39,630
Hold on. Pause, pause.

31
00:02:39,420 --> 00:02:43,600
[Prosperous Dynasty]

32
00:02:40,750 --> 00:02:42,360
Look, Bus No. 107.

33
00:02:43,690 --> 00:02:44,900
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

34
00:02:48,710 --> 00:02:50,430
We've reached Li's son.

35
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:51,960
He said Li never made it home,

36
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:52,870
and they don't have any relatives

37
00:02:52,870 --> 00:02:54,560
living along the No. 107 bus route.

38
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:55,840
Based on the direction Li was traveling,

39
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:57,470
there should be 6 more stops.

40
00:02:57,680 --> 00:02:59,240
We'll have to check with people
at each stop, one by one.

41
00:02:58,530 --> 00:02:59,720
[Old Mill Housing Complex]

42
00:03:05,390 --> 00:03:07,610
[Old Mill Housing Complex] [107]

43
00:03:06,710 --> 00:03:08,280
He was wearing a hospital gown

44
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:09,080
and got off Bus No. 107.

45
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:10,000
Ring any bells?

46
00:03:13,370 --> 00:03:16,820
[Next Stop: Tuyingqiao]

47
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:19,190
Hello, sir.

48
00:03:19,280 --> 00:03:19,710
Excuse me,

49
00:03:19,710 --> 00:03:21,170
but have you seen this man?

50
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:22,430
About this tall,

51
00:03:22,430 --> 00:03:22,960
wearing blue.

52
00:03:22,960 --> 00:03:24,290
Can I ask you something?

53
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:26,310
About 1.8 meters tall.

54
00:03:26,470 --> 00:03:27,190
Thank you.

55
00:03:29,150 --> 00:03:30,680
North of Jianping Factory,

56
00:03:30,910 --> 00:03:32,040
east of the bus stop.

57
00:03:32,150 --> 00:03:33,210
Let's all meet up there.

58
00:03:33,210 --> 00:03:35,260
[Erligou Pass]

59
00:03:35,320 --> 00:03:37,560
[Next Stop: Jianping Factory]

60
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:52,800
Uncle Li!

61
00:03:53,310 --> 00:03:54,120
Stop!

62
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:57,020
I'm from Xiaoximen Hospital.

63
00:03:57,310 --> 00:03:59,970
I've been looking for you all morning,
Uncle Li.

64
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:06,400
Um, Uncle Li.

65
00:04:06,710 --> 00:04:08,240
I'm from Xiaoximen Hospital.

66
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:11,520
I used to work at this Jianping Factory.

67
00:04:13,630 --> 00:04:15,630
Back when the factory was thriving,

68
00:04:16,390 --> 00:04:18,070
they built 2 railway lines

69
00:04:18,750 --> 00:04:19,880
to transport goods.

70
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:22,680
And every day,

71
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:26,190
I'd sit in this little shack

72
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:28,430
and operate

73
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:31,090
this railway turntable.

74
00:04:31,480 --> 00:04:32,680
So you're revisiting
your old stomping grounds,

75
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:35,070
reminiscing about
the good old days, huh?

76
00:04:42,750 --> 00:04:44,360
It was 1988.

77
00:04:46,560 --> 00:04:49,090
I wanted to go to Shenyang
to start a business,

78
00:04:50,390 --> 00:04:52,120
but my dad wouldn't hear of it.

79
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:54,630
He even

80
00:04:54,630 --> 00:04:56,070
pulled some strings

81
00:04:57,390 --> 00:04:59,480
to get me a job at Jianping Factory.

82
00:05:01,390 --> 00:05:02,190
Every day,

83
00:05:02,950 --> 00:05:03,830
I'd just

84
00:05:03,830 --> 00:05:05,310
sit in this little shack,

85
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:08,800
operating this railway turntable,

86
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:10,400
turning it this way and that.

87
00:05:11,600 --> 00:05:13,070
Back then, I thought

88
00:05:14,830 --> 00:05:15,960
I had it pretty good.

89
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:19,800
But looking back now,

90
00:05:21,310 --> 00:05:23,000
I actually wasted my life.

91
00:05:25,240 --> 00:05:26,630
What a waste of life.

92
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:28,870
I let myself go,

93
00:05:29,920 --> 00:05:31,920
and then the factory went bankrupt.

94
00:05:33,070 --> 00:05:33,750
If I could

95
00:05:36,040 --> 00:05:37,510
live my life over,

96
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:40,120
I'd definitely

97
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:41,360
follow my own ideas,

98
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:43,510
turn my own turntable,

99
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:46,120
and choose the path I wanted to take.

100
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:47,800
No matter what,

101
00:05:47,800 --> 00:05:49,560
I wouldn't end up like this—

102
00:05:49,560 --> 00:05:50,950
in my sixties

103
00:05:50,950 --> 00:05:52,480
with absolutely nothing
to look forward to,

104
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:53,810
just filled with regret

105
00:05:54,430 --> 00:05:56,310
every single day.

106
00:05:56,560 --> 00:05:59,020
Uncle Li, things aren't so bad now,
are they?

107
00:06:02,480 --> 00:06:03,160
Dad!

108
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:05,190
Why are you wandering around
in this freezing cold?

109
00:06:05,190 --> 00:06:06,600
What if you pass out from the cold?

110
00:06:06,600 --> 00:06:07,120
Come on,

111
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:08,110
let's get you back to the hospital.

112
00:06:08,110 --> 00:06:08,870
Son.

113
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:12,830
I lied.

114
00:06:14,360 --> 00:06:17,000
I don't have Alzheimer's at all.

115
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:22,870
I just wanted you two

116
00:06:22,870 --> 00:06:24,750
to pay a little more attention to me.

117
00:06:24,750 --> 00:06:26,240
That's why I...

118
00:06:26,430 --> 00:06:27,890
That's why I said all that.

119
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:31,390
I know.

120
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:34,270
You know?

121
00:06:36,190 --> 00:06:37,320
Xiaohong knows too.

122
00:06:41,430 --> 00:06:42,510
So you two...

123
00:06:43,430 --> 00:06:45,390
You two have been

124
00:06:46,070 --> 00:06:47,360
playing along with me this whole time?

125
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:48,720
Dad, we only

126
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:50,120
figured it out recently.

127
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:52,870
Xiaohong said we shouldn't tell you yet

128
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:55,430
b-because she was worried
you'd feel embarrassed.

129
00:06:55,430 --> 00:06:56,680
Dad, it's okay.

130
00:06:57,240 --> 00:06:59,640
It's better to be healthy
than sick, right?

131
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:02,520
You're right.

132
00:07:05,160 --> 00:07:07,160
It's better to be healthy than sick.

133
00:07:10,480 --> 00:07:11,270
My son.

134
00:07:12,750 --> 00:07:14,430
I've had time to think it over,

135
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:16,700
and I've come to my senses.

136
00:07:18,070 --> 00:07:18,870
I

137
00:07:20,190 --> 00:07:20,920
really shouldn't have

138
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:22,580
given you two such a hard time,

139
00:07:23,430 --> 00:07:25,040
let alone accused you of

140
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:27,170
being unfilial in front of the doctor.

141
00:07:29,360 --> 00:07:31,390
Deep down, I know better than anyone

142
00:07:31,390 --> 00:07:32,430
that you two are the most filial

143
00:07:32,430 --> 00:07:33,830
of all.

144
00:07:38,240 --> 00:07:39,040
Alright.

145
00:07:39,430 --> 00:07:40,240
Let's go home.

146
00:07:41,270 --> 00:07:43,159
Apologize to Xiaohong for me.

147
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:44,360
Dad.

148
00:07:45,310 --> 00:07:47,510
Let's go back to the hospital, alright?

149
00:07:48,630 --> 00:07:49,270
Okay.

150
00:07:50,120 --> 00:07:51,320
Back to the hospital.

151
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:58,560
Sorry

152
00:07:59,190 --> 00:08:01,800
for causing you so much trouble.

153
00:08:02,190 --> 00:08:02,750
It's okay.

154
00:08:02,750 --> 00:08:03,750
It's okay, Uncle Li.

155
00:08:03,750 --> 00:08:04,600
Let's go back.

156
00:08:05,070 --> 00:08:05,950
Be careful. Careful.

157
00:08:05,950 --> 00:08:06,720
I'm fine. Don't worry.

158
00:08:06,720 --> 00:08:07,920
Be careful. Careful.

159
00:08:10,480 --> 00:08:11,540
-Dad.
-Be careful.

160
00:08:12,800 --> 00:08:15,260
Honestly, I'm even more scared
than you are.

161
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:17,390
I've already lost Mom.

162
00:08:18,750 --> 00:08:20,610
I can't afford to lose you as well.

163
00:08:21,240 --> 00:08:22,570
I'm here for you, my son.

164
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:25,650
I've never amounted to much

165
00:08:27,070 --> 00:08:28,390
in my life.

166
00:08:29,160 --> 00:08:31,390
The one thing I can be proud of,

167
00:08:31,390 --> 00:08:33,049
the one thing I can brag about,

168
00:08:33,669 --> 00:08:34,390
is raising

169
00:08:34,390 --> 00:08:35,789
a son as wonderful as you.

170
00:08:37,030 --> 00:08:39,440
You've made more of yourself
than I ever did,

171
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:41,440
and you're a better person than I am.

172
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:52,880
What's wrong?

173
00:09:02,790 --> 00:09:04,200
Ai Chen, where are you going?

174
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:06,490
[Heping Road]

175
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:07,030
I borrowed that e-bike!
I've got to return it!

176
00:09:07,030 --> 00:09:09,720
If I could live my life over,

177
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:11,120
I'd definitely

178
00:09:11,120 --> 00:09:12,360
follow my own ideas

179
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:14,360
and turn my own turntable.

180
00:09:14,360 --> 00:09:15,120
No matter what,

181
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:16,910
I wouldn't end up like this—

182
00:09:16,910 --> 00:09:18,240
in my sixties

183
00:09:18,240 --> 00:09:19,750
with absolutely nothing
to look forward to,

184
00:09:19,750 --> 00:09:21,080
just filled with regret

185
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:23,550
every single day.

186
00:09:23,550 --> 00:09:24,870
Here's what I believe:

187
00:09:24,910 --> 00:09:26,170
If you like something,

188
00:09:26,600 --> 00:09:27,550
go for it;

189
00:09:27,550 --> 00:09:29,350
if you go for it, give it your all;

190
00:09:29,510 --> 00:09:30,960
and if you give it your all,

191
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:32,360
you'll leave no regrets.

192
00:09:36,230 --> 00:09:37,450
[Friendly Reminder:
Non-Motorized Vehicle Parking Area]

193
00:09:39,590 --> 00:09:40,940
[Friendly Reminder:
Non-Motorized Vehicle Parking Area]

194
00:09:44,850 --> 00:09:49,370
[Fucheng North Station]

195
00:09:49,410 --> 00:09:51,100
[Ticket Sales Closed]
[Station Service Hotline]

196
00:09:56,840 --> 00:09:57,440
Hello.

197
00:09:57,440 --> 00:09:58,630
Hello, I'd like a ticket

198
00:09:58,630 --> 00:10:02,230
to the provincial capital
on the earliest available departure.

199
00:10:03,080 --> 00:10:03,910
Excuse me.

200
00:10:12,030 --> 00:10:12,790
Hello?

201
00:10:13,910 --> 00:10:15,240
What's up? Playing mahjong?

202
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:15,960
Alright, Mom, hurry up

203
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:17,020
and book me a flight

204
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:19,080
from the provincial capital to Fuzhou.

205
00:10:19,080 --> 00:10:20,150
Got it.

206
00:10:21,720 --> 00:10:22,360
What?

207
00:10:23,200 --> 00:10:23,930
Buy you what?

208
00:10:24,480 --> 00:10:25,410
A flight ticket?

209
00:10:26,390 --> 00:10:27,750
I'm on the train

210
00:10:27,870 --> 00:10:29,930
to the provincial capital right now.

211
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:32,200
I've thought it through.

212
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:33,930
I need to go see Liu Zhengliang.

213
00:10:34,390 --> 00:10:35,150
I'm doing this for myself,

214
00:10:35,150 --> 00:10:35,960
not for him.

215
00:10:37,630 --> 00:10:38,510
I was thinking,

216
00:10:38,870 --> 00:10:40,390
don't you think we need to clear things up

217
00:10:40,390 --> 00:10:41,750
between us?

218
00:10:42,320 --> 00:10:43,270
Once I'm there,

219
00:10:43,270 --> 00:10:44,440
no matter how things turn out,

220
00:10:44,440 --> 00:10:46,440
at least I won't have any regrets, right?

221
00:10:46,440 --> 00:10:47,320
But

222
00:10:47,550 --> 00:10:48,720
everything I told you that day

223
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:50,200
was how I truly felt.

224
00:10:50,200 --> 00:10:51,510
That definitely won't change.

225
00:10:51,510 --> 00:10:52,670
Don't worry.

226
00:10:52,870 --> 00:10:53,720
Sweetheart.

227
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:55,390
I understand.

228
00:10:55,720 --> 00:10:57,850
You've got my unconditional support.

229
00:11:00,390 --> 00:11:02,000
Put the mahjong on pause.
I've got an important announcement.

230
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:03,440
But we had a big win going.

231
00:11:03,870 --> 00:11:05,720
If we stop now, you've got to pay up.

232
00:11:05,720 --> 00:11:07,520
Our daughter is going to Fuzhou.

233
00:11:07,790 --> 00:11:08,630
What's she going

234
00:11:08,630 --> 00:11:09,840
all the way out there for?

235
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:11,700
To see Liu Zhengliang, of course.

236
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:14,240
Zhao, we're calling it a day.

237
00:11:14,240 --> 00:11:14,910
Alright then.

238
00:11:14,910 --> 00:11:15,480
Xiaozhu,

239
00:11:15,480 --> 00:11:16,670
hurry and book your sis a flight

240
00:11:16,670 --> 00:11:18,270
from the provincial capital to Fuzhou.

241
00:11:18,270 --> 00:11:19,080
Within the next 3 hours.

242
00:11:19,080 --> 00:11:20,410
The sooner, the better.

243
00:11:20,960 --> 00:11:21,720
San,

244
00:11:22,120 --> 00:11:24,120
pack some clothes for Ai Chen.

245
00:11:24,240 --> 00:11:25,790
She didn't take anything with her.

246
00:11:25,790 --> 00:11:27,630
Let's mail them to her right away.

247
00:11:27,630 --> 00:11:28,510
Sweetheart.

248
00:11:29,510 --> 00:11:31,710
If you run into any trouble on the plane,

249
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:32,840
don't be shy.

250
00:11:33,480 --> 00:11:34,790
Just ask for help.

251
00:11:36,550 --> 00:11:37,790
Don't turn off your phone.

252
00:11:37,790 --> 00:11:39,000
When you see Liu Zhengliang,

253
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:40,200
give me a call.

254
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:42,120
Got it. Don't worry.

255
00:11:42,120 --> 00:11:43,720
Just wait for me to come back.

256
00:11:44,360 --> 00:11:45,600
Mom, you're the best.

257
00:11:51,840 --> 00:11:52,600
Doctor.

258
00:11:53,870 --> 00:11:56,480
A-Am I going to be okay?

259
00:11:57,120 --> 00:11:57,910
You are.

260
00:11:58,150 --> 00:11:59,030
Don't worry.

261
00:11:59,270 --> 00:12:00,130
You'll be fine.

262
00:12:02,870 --> 00:12:03,670
Don't worry.

263
00:12:13,960 --> 00:12:14,750
Let's begin.

264
00:12:45,510 --> 00:12:47,170
Balloon catheter, size four.

265
00:12:58,600 --> 00:13:00,000
Balloon is in position.

266
00:13:00,150 --> 00:13:01,150
Begin inflation.

267
00:13:18,150 --> 00:13:19,550
The patient's heart has stopped!

268
00:13:19,550 --> 00:13:21,480
Deflate the balloon immediately.

269
00:13:21,510 --> 00:13:23,630
Administer 1 milligram of atropine
intravenously!

270
00:13:23,630 --> 00:13:24,440
Li?

271
00:13:25,600 --> 00:13:26,390
Li?

272
00:13:27,510 --> 00:13:28,320
Li?

273
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:29,510
Li?

274
00:13:29,600 --> 00:13:30,600
Can you hear me?

275
00:13:30,600 --> 00:13:31,360
Li?

276
00:13:31,390 --> 00:13:33,390
Li, are you feeling any discomfort?

277
00:13:33,790 --> 00:13:35,200
Li, don't fall asleep.

278
00:13:35,320 --> 00:13:36,120
Li.

279
00:13:36,440 --> 00:13:37,750
Stay with us, Li.

280
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:42,320
Cough, cough, Li.

281
00:13:43,200 --> 00:13:44,030
Cough a bit.

282
00:13:45,630 --> 00:13:47,600
Alright. You're okay.

283
00:13:50,440 --> 00:13:51,790
The patient's heartbeat is back to normal.

284
00:13:51,790 --> 00:13:53,050
Resume the procedure.

285
00:13:58,510 --> 00:13:59,510
Pass me the stent.

286
00:14:00,030 --> 00:14:02,320
♪ Walk a mile or two down the road ♪

287
00:14:03,120 --> 00:14:05,620
♪ Past four or five homes in a village ♪

288
00:14:07,630 --> 00:14:10,030
♪ Beyond eight or nine pavilions ♪

289
00:14:11,200 --> 00:14:16,960
♪ Ten or so branches lead to
the west wing ♪

290
00:14:17,870 --> 00:14:20,390
♪ How do I get to the west wing? ♪

291
00:14:20,870 --> 00:14:27,240
♪ The west wing lies
just beyond one wall ♪

292
00:15:09,720 --> 00:15:14,740
[Fujian Kangtaierke Hospital]

293
00:15:27,480 --> 00:15:28,480
What are you up to?

294
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:30,260
Are you busy right now?

295
00:15:30,720 --> 00:15:32,580
Go ahead. I'm free for the moment.

296
00:15:37,150 --> 00:15:39,240
Well, come downstairs.

297
00:15:39,720 --> 00:15:40,960
I'm outside your workplace.

298
00:15:40,960 --> 00:15:42,510
What? What workplace?

299
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:44,270
Bro.

300
00:15:44,270 --> 00:15:45,550
Put your phone away.

301
00:15:45,550 --> 00:15:47,680
The roller coaster's about to depart.

302
00:15:48,080 --> 00:15:48,870
Hello?

303
00:15:50,200 --> 00:15:51,930
Speak louder. I can't hear you.

304
00:15:53,720 --> 00:15:55,120
Hurry up.

305
00:15:55,910 --> 00:15:56,720
I'm right outside

306
00:15:56,720 --> 00:15:58,510
the hospital where you work in Fuzhou.

307
00:15:58,510 --> 00:15:59,480
What are you doing in Fuzhou?

308
00:15:59,480 --> 00:16:00,480
I'm not in Fuzhou.

309
00:16:00,870 --> 00:16:02,790
What kind of question is that?
I'm here to see you, of course.

310
00:16:02,790 --> 00:16:03,910
I'm in Bengbu.

311
00:16:05,150 --> 00:16:06,200
What? What do you mean?

312
00:16:06,200 --> 00:16:07,360
Hurry, hurry. Put it away. Come on.

313
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:09,320
-We're about to depart. Hurry.
-Aren't you at

314
00:16:09,320 --> 00:16:10,670
this... what's it called? Kang...
Kangertai Hospital in Fuzhou?

315
00:16:10,670 --> 00:16:11,480
The signal's bad here.

316
00:16:11,480 --> 00:16:12,120
I can't hear you.

317
00:16:12,120 --> 00:16:13,720
You don't work here anymore?

318
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:19,260
Why are you yelling?

319
00:16:32,360 --> 00:16:34,290
You aren't being bullied, are you?

320
00:16:40,460 --> 00:16:41,520
[If you're not wearing an employee ID card,
please place your bag]

321
00:16:41,520 --> 00:16:43,130
[through the security scanner and walk through
the security gate. Thank you.]

322
00:17:24,030 --> 00:17:24,829
Hello,

323
00:17:25,349 --> 00:17:26,640
are you the one
looking for Liu Zhengliang?

324
00:17:26,640 --> 00:17:28,240
Yes, that would be me. Hello.

325
00:17:28,510 --> 00:17:29,960
Pardon me. Well,

326
00:17:30,790 --> 00:17:32,070
does Dr. Liu Zhengliang

327
00:17:32,070 --> 00:17:33,240
work here?

328
00:17:33,510 --> 00:17:34,310
I asked the front desk,

329
00:17:34,310 --> 00:17:35,750
but they said there's no such person.

330
00:17:35,750 --> 00:17:36,410
Well, yeah.

331
00:17:36,960 --> 00:17:38,960
What's your relationship with him?

332
00:17:38,960 --> 00:17:39,830
I'm his friend.

333
00:17:40,310 --> 00:17:41,200
He was supposed to

334
00:17:41,200 --> 00:17:42,640
come work here,

335
00:17:42,640 --> 00:17:44,110
but due to
circumstances beyond his control,

336
00:17:44,110 --> 00:17:45,040
he never made it.

337
00:17:45,830 --> 00:17:47,200
What do you mean by
"circumstances beyond his control?"

338
00:17:47,200 --> 00:17:48,830
Just some special circumstances.

339
00:17:48,830 --> 00:17:51,290
But it had nothing to do
with Liu Zhengliang.

340
00:17:52,070 --> 00:17:52,880
Alright then.

341
00:17:55,110 --> 00:17:56,310
What a mess.

342
00:17:57,240 --> 00:17:57,920
Do you know

343
00:17:57,920 --> 00:17:59,200
where he is now?

344
00:17:59,440 --> 00:18:01,030
I'm afraid I don't.

345
00:18:01,110 --> 00:18:02,110
I've only been in touch with him

346
00:18:02,110 --> 00:18:03,110
over the phone.

347
00:18:04,310 --> 00:18:05,510
Alright, thanks.

348
00:18:05,590 --> 00:18:06,270
You're welcome.

349
00:18:06,270 --> 00:18:07,030
Okay.

350
00:18:07,510 --> 00:18:08,310
Hold on.

351
00:18:09,070 --> 00:18:09,920
There's something

352
00:18:09,920 --> 00:18:11,510
that seems to belong to Dr. Liu.

353
00:18:11,510 --> 00:18:13,110
Why don't you take it for him?

354
00:18:13,240 --> 00:18:14,000
What is it?

355
00:18:14,400 --> 00:18:15,200
Wait here for a moment.

356
00:18:15,200 --> 00:18:16,400
I'll go get it for you.

357
00:18:16,920 --> 00:18:17,780
Take your time.

358
00:18:20,160 --> 00:18:20,960
What a ride.

359
00:18:22,030 --> 00:18:22,830
Thrilling!

360
00:18:30,880 --> 00:18:31,790
You startled me.

361
00:18:31,790 --> 00:18:32,470
The ride's over.

362
00:18:32,470 --> 00:18:34,270
Please unfasten your seatbelt.

363
00:18:34,400 --> 00:18:36,790
Take your belongings
and don't leave anything behind.

364
00:18:36,790 --> 00:18:37,510
Double-check

365
00:18:37,510 --> 00:18:38,960
your personal belongings.

366
00:18:38,960 --> 00:18:40,620
Don't leave anything behind.

367
00:18:40,790 --> 00:18:41,790
Where's my phone?

368
00:18:42,830 --> 00:18:44,510
Didn't you put it in your pocket?

369
00:18:44,510 --> 00:18:46,170
Go down the stairs on the left.

370
00:18:46,830 --> 00:18:47,880
Watch your step.

371
00:18:48,270 --> 00:18:49,730
This way. This way please.

372
00:18:52,640 --> 00:18:53,700
I dropped my phone.

373
00:19:08,920 --> 00:19:09,720
Found it.

374
00:19:11,000 --> 00:19:11,750
Let me see.

375
00:19:16,350 --> 00:19:17,160
How is it?

376
00:19:30,920 --> 00:19:32,050
My job fell through,

377
00:19:33,350 --> 00:19:34,610
and my luggage's gone.

378
00:19:35,790 --> 00:19:36,750
I've got nothing on me

379
00:19:36,750 --> 00:19:38,610
except this phone, and I broke it.

380
00:19:53,960 --> 00:19:54,750
Wait.

381
00:19:56,160 --> 00:19:58,240
Bro, a-are you okay?

382
00:20:00,880 --> 00:20:02,070
Am I okay?

383
00:20:03,830 --> 00:20:05,350
Do I look okay to you?

384
00:20:11,960 --> 00:20:13,490
Was the roller coaster fun?

385
00:20:14,720 --> 00:20:15,580
Was it fun, huh?

386
00:20:16,680 --> 00:20:17,550
Why did you have to ride it?

387
00:20:17,550 --> 00:20:19,350
What's so great about it anyway!

388
00:20:23,310 --> 00:20:24,110
Stop yelling!

389
00:20:26,680 --> 00:20:27,940
Why are you blaming me?

390
00:20:29,070 --> 00:20:30,030
Didn't I remind you

391
00:20:30,030 --> 00:20:31,240
to put your phone away

392
00:20:31,270 --> 00:20:32,350
before the ride started?

393
00:20:32,350 --> 00:20:33,680
I told you to put it away,

394
00:20:33,720 --> 00:20:36,580
but you wouldn't listen.
And now you're blaming me?

395
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:55,460
I'm laughing so hard
I'm about to split a gut.

396
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:06,830
You're right.

397
00:21:09,310 --> 00:21:10,570
Why should I blame you?

398
00:21:13,880 --> 00:21:15,540
I've only got myself to blame.

399
00:21:18,830 --> 00:21:19,830
It's all my fault.

400
00:21:20,880 --> 00:21:21,680
I shouldn't have come here

401
00:21:21,680 --> 00:21:22,740
in the first place.

402
00:21:24,920 --> 00:21:25,720
No, wait.

403
00:21:28,880 --> 00:21:29,640
I shouldn't have studied medicine

404
00:21:29,640 --> 00:21:30,960
in the first place.

405
00:21:34,640 --> 00:21:36,300
If I hadn't studied medicine,

406
00:21:37,880 --> 00:21:39,880
I wouldn't have performed surgery.

407
00:21:41,000 --> 00:21:42,730
If I hadn't performed surgery,

408
00:21:44,110 --> 00:21:45,640
I wouldn't have been fired.

409
00:21:48,790 --> 00:21:50,050
If I hadn't been fired,

410
00:21:51,240 --> 00:21:52,970
I wouldn't have gone back home.

411
00:21:55,000 --> 00:21:56,460
If I hadn't gone back home,

412
00:21:59,510 --> 00:22:01,110
I wouldn't have ended up at
Xiaoximen Hospital,

413
00:22:01,110 --> 00:22:03,110
dealing with that bunch of weirdos.

414
00:22:05,960 --> 00:22:09,020
Then I wouldn't be in
this embarrassing mess right now.

415
00:22:20,000 --> 00:22:20,830
Wait.

416
00:22:21,720 --> 00:22:22,440
Bro.

417
00:22:24,160 --> 00:22:24,960
It's my fault.

418
00:22:25,440 --> 00:22:26,300
Blame me, okay?

419
00:22:26,920 --> 00:22:28,050
Don't get worked up.

420
00:22:29,200 --> 00:22:30,460
C-Calm down, alright?

421
00:22:53,550 --> 00:22:54,350
Let's go.

422
00:23:00,160 --> 00:23:00,920
Wait.

423
00:23:03,880 --> 00:23:04,940
Where are we going?

424
00:23:05,030 --> 00:23:06,110
To fix my phone.

425
00:23:09,030 --> 00:23:09,830
Perfect.

426
00:23:10,270 --> 00:23:11,200
I've got a friend

427
00:23:11,240 --> 00:23:12,440
who fixes phones.

428
00:23:12,880 --> 00:23:13,680
Don't worry.

429
00:23:13,960 --> 00:23:15,270
I'll make sure he

430
00:23:15,270 --> 00:23:16,530
gets your phone fixed.

431
00:23:16,880 --> 00:23:17,830
That's great.

432
00:23:20,960 --> 00:23:22,420
So you're not mad anymore?

433
00:23:22,830 --> 00:23:23,640
Childish.

434
00:23:24,110 --> 00:23:25,750
What's the point of getting mad?

435
00:23:25,750 --> 00:23:27,440
It won't solve anything.

436
00:23:28,960 --> 00:23:30,110
Really? You've calmed down for real?

437
00:23:30,110 --> 00:23:30,960
Sure.

438
00:23:33,960 --> 00:23:34,550
Great.

439
00:23:34,550 --> 00:23:35,510
Then... Then how about

440
00:23:35,510 --> 00:23:37,400
a ride on the pirate ship before we go?

441
00:23:37,400 --> 00:23:39,460
You think you can push your luck, huh?

442
00:23:41,160 --> 00:23:43,360
"You think you can push your luck, huh?"

443
00:23:43,680 --> 00:23:44,400
Don't even get me started, Mom.

444
00:23:44,400 --> 00:23:45,680
My legs are killing me,

445
00:23:45,720 --> 00:23:47,270
and I didn't even get to see him.

446
00:23:47,270 --> 00:23:49,880
Apparently, he's gone to Bengbu.

447
00:23:51,510 --> 00:23:52,550
Bengbu?

448
00:23:53,440 --> 00:23:54,480
I've got no idea.

449
00:23:54,510 --> 00:23:55,640
Look it up, will you?

450
00:23:56,960 --> 00:23:58,680
Xiaozhu, help me check

451
00:23:58,680 --> 00:24:00,790
the train tickets from Fuzhou to Bengbu.

452
00:24:00,790 --> 00:24:01,830
Bengbu?

453
00:24:02,350 --> 00:24:03,080
Sweetheart,

454
00:24:03,720 --> 00:24:05,120
it's getting late today.

455
00:24:05,400 --> 00:24:07,720
You might not be able
to get a train ticket today.

456
00:24:07,720 --> 00:24:09,320
Why don't you find somewhere

457
00:24:10,030 --> 00:24:11,200
t-to stay for the night

458
00:24:11,200 --> 00:24:13,200
and figure something out tomorrow?

459
00:24:13,830 --> 00:24:16,290
Don't forget to charge your phone,
alright?

460
00:24:19,440 --> 00:24:20,510
Where's Bengbu?

461
00:24:20,590 --> 00:24:21,240
In Henan.

462
00:24:23,110 --> 00:24:24,510
I think it's in Shandong.

463
00:24:24,720 --> 00:24:25,790
It's in Anhui.

464
00:24:26,790 --> 00:24:27,590
Wait,

465
00:24:27,960 --> 00:24:29,920
why's she going to Anhui now?

466
00:24:29,920 --> 00:24:31,780
To see Liu Zhengliang, of course.

467
00:24:32,400 --> 00:24:33,720
That Liu Zhengliang—

468
00:24:34,510 --> 00:24:36,070
he's in his thirties.

469
00:24:36,240 --> 00:24:38,000
yet he has no car, no house,

470
00:24:38,550 --> 00:24:39,400
no money,

471
00:24:39,750 --> 00:24:41,880
a-and no emotional intelligence.

472
00:24:42,400 --> 00:24:43,270
Why on earth would our daughter

473
00:24:43,270 --> 00:24:45,310
go all the way out there to see him?

474
00:24:46,550 --> 00:24:47,550
What did you have
when I got together with you

475
00:24:47,550 --> 00:24:48,440
back then?

476
00:24:57,440 --> 00:24:58,270
I had love.

477
00:25:03,480 --> 00:25:04,440
That's true.

478
00:25:04,540 --> 00:25:07,770
[Cell Phone Repair][Screen Replacement]

479
00:25:08,030 --> 00:25:08,640
Here.

480
00:25:15,160 --> 00:25:16,590
How much longer do you need?

481
00:25:16,590 --> 00:25:18,110
Almost done. Easy, easy.

482
00:25:23,030 --> 00:25:24,720
Bro, passions. Passions.

483
00:25:25,880 --> 00:25:27,030
Look at you,

484
00:25:27,160 --> 00:25:28,440
speaking English.

485
00:25:28,550 --> 00:25:30,640
"Passions?" You mean "patience."

486
00:25:32,720 --> 00:25:33,510
Right.

487
00:25:33,550 --> 00:25:34,440
If I'm happy,

488
00:25:34,440 --> 00:25:36,170
I can even speak bird language.

489
00:25:37,200 --> 00:25:38,000
It's fixed.

490
00:25:38,070 --> 00:25:39,400
Take off the leather cover tomorrow.

491
00:25:39,400 --> 00:25:40,160
How much?

492
00:25:40,640 --> 00:25:41,440
Five hundred.

493
00:25:42,110 --> 00:25:42,920
Say it again?

494
00:25:43,790 --> 00:25:44,590
Five hundred.

495
00:25:47,440 --> 00:25:48,510
I'll handle it.

496
00:25:49,240 --> 00:25:50,640
Go wait for me at the door.

497
00:26:01,830 --> 00:26:02,510
Hello?

498
00:26:02,510 --> 00:26:04,770
Didn't you say you were coming to Fuzhou?

499
00:26:04,880 --> 00:26:06,410
Why did you end up in Bengbu?

500
00:26:07,240 --> 00:26:08,200
There was a problem

501
00:26:08,200 --> 00:26:09,460
with the train I was on,

502
00:26:09,510 --> 00:26:10,770
so my trip got delayed.

503
00:26:12,000 --> 00:26:12,830
So are you still coming?

504
00:26:12,540 --> 00:26:17,210
[Guangming Guesthouse]

505
00:26:13,640 --> 00:26:14,440
I'm not.

506
00:26:14,830 --> 00:26:15,510
The hospital

507
00:26:15,510 --> 00:26:17,480
that was going to hire me
changed its mind.

508
00:26:17,480 --> 00:26:18,400
Listen,

509
00:26:18,440 --> 00:26:19,400
wherever you are right now,

510
00:26:19,400 --> 00:26:21,400
get home as soon as possible. Got it?

511
00:26:22,510 --> 00:26:23,960
Then I'll come to Bengbu.

512
00:26:24,270 --> 00:26:26,070
What are you coming to Bengbu
to see me for?

513
00:26:26,070 --> 00:26:28,330
I have something to say to you, of course.

514
00:26:28,880 --> 00:26:30,940
Can't you just tell me over the phone?

515
00:26:31,240 --> 00:26:32,830
Some things must be said in person.

516
00:26:32,830 --> 00:26:36,550
What could possibly be so important
that you have to say it face-to-face?

517
00:26:36,550 --> 00:26:38,680
You're not going to try to talk me
into going back, are you?

518
00:26:38,680 --> 00:26:40,110
Because that's not happening.

519
00:26:40,110 --> 00:26:40,830
Seriously,

520
00:26:40,830 --> 00:26:42,000
why are you being so difficult?

521
00:26:42,000 --> 00:26:44,000
I told you, we need to

522
00:26:44,240 --> 00:26:45,640
talk in person.

523
00:26:46,030 --> 00:26:47,000
Just send me your address.

524
00:26:47,000 --> 00:26:48,130
What's the big deal?

525
00:26:48,550 --> 00:26:50,010
Is that really necessary?

526
00:26:50,350 --> 00:26:51,210
Of course it is!

527
00:26:51,640 --> 00:26:52,880
I've got this suitcase here,

528
00:26:52,880 --> 00:26:54,280
and it's freaking heavy.

529
00:26:54,750 --> 00:26:55,550
I can't

530
00:26:56,960 --> 00:26:58,110
make heads or tails

531
00:26:58,110 --> 00:27:00,400
of these books,

532
00:27:00,190 --> 00:27:03,980
[Home Service]

533
00:27:01,480 --> 00:27:02,270
but

534
00:27:02,270 --> 00:27:03,670
they're all about skulls

535
00:27:03,920 --> 00:27:05,110
and skeletons and stuff.

536
00:27:05,110 --> 00:27:06,510
Must be medical books.

537
00:27:06,550 --> 00:27:08,640
There are clothes,

538
00:27:09,350 --> 00:27:10,510
some socks,

539
00:27:11,310 --> 00:27:12,590
and a few

540
00:27:13,550 --> 00:27:15,200
tiny yellow panties.

541
00:27:15,400 --> 00:27:18,480
No idea whose they are.

542
00:27:19,880 --> 00:27:21,480
They've got little bees on them.

543
00:27:21,480 --> 00:27:22,000
Wait...

544
00:27:24,920 --> 00:27:25,750
Hey, wait a minute.

545
00:27:25,750 --> 00:27:26,270
Wait a minute.

546
00:27:26,270 --> 00:27:28,750
W-What you are doing is...

547
00:27:28,880 --> 00:27:29,680
That's

548
00:27:30,000 --> 00:27:31,440
a violation of my privacy,

549
00:27:31,440 --> 00:27:32,240
you know?

550
00:27:32,960 --> 00:27:34,740
W-Why do you have my suitcase?

551
00:27:34,790 --> 00:27:35,750
Oh, it's yours?

552
00:27:36,200 --> 00:27:37,200
That makes sense.

553
00:27:37,550 --> 00:27:39,160
Didn't I go to that hospital—

554
00:27:39,160 --> 00:27:41,030
it's called Kangtaierke, right?

555
00:27:41,160 --> 00:27:42,960
They knew I was looking for you,

556
00:27:43,440 --> 00:27:45,070
so they gave me this suitcase,

557
00:27:45,070 --> 00:27:46,750
saying someone sent it by courier.

558
00:27:46,750 --> 00:27:47,270
But you still can't

559
00:27:47,270 --> 00:27:48,680
just open my suitcase.

560
00:27:48,880 --> 00:27:49,880
I had to see if there were

561
00:27:49,880 --> 00:27:52,010
any dangerous items inside, alright?

562
00:27:52,030 --> 00:27:52,830
Fine.

563
00:27:53,480 --> 00:27:55,080
You're done looking, right?

564
00:27:55,590 --> 00:27:56,480
Put everything back as it was,

565
00:27:56,480 --> 00:27:57,590
and close the suitcase for me.

566
00:27:57,590 --> 00:27:59,550
It's hard to put it back
exactly as it was.

567
00:27:59,550 --> 00:28:00,510
It's too messy.

568
00:28:00,510 --> 00:28:01,000
How about I help you

569
00:28:01,000 --> 00:28:02,110
organize it properly

570
00:28:02,110 --> 00:28:02,480
later?

571
00:28:02,480 --> 00:28:04,400
I don't need your help organizing it.

572
00:28:04,400 --> 00:28:05,960
Just ship me the suitcase,

573
00:28:06,030 --> 00:28:07,240
and I'll pay the postage when it arrives.

574
00:28:07,240 --> 00:28:07,960
Sure.

575
00:28:08,030 --> 00:28:09,750
Then give me your address.

576
00:28:09,960 --> 00:28:10,790
Bengbu City,

577
00:28:11,960 --> 00:28:13,070
Dream Garden...

578
00:28:14,110 --> 00:28:15,110
No, wait a minute.

579
00:28:15,200 --> 00:28:16,720
You're tricking me, aren't you?

580
00:28:16,720 --> 00:28:17,640
If I give you the address,

581
00:28:17,640 --> 00:28:19,240
you'll come over, won't you?

582
00:28:21,510 --> 00:28:23,240
You're really something, I...

583
00:28:23,510 --> 00:28:25,310
If you don't give me the address,

584
00:28:25,590 --> 00:28:27,450
how am I supposed to ship it to you?

585
00:28:29,640 --> 00:28:30,590
Besides,

586
00:28:30,900 --> 00:28:34,640
[Guangming Guesthouse]

587
00:28:31,640 --> 00:28:32,960
am I a monster or something?

588
00:28:32,960 --> 00:28:34,240
Like I'm going to eat you.

589
00:28:34,240 --> 00:28:35,270
Trying to stop me.

590
00:28:35,270 --> 00:28:36,800
You're just unbelievable.

591
00:28:37,480 --> 00:28:39,080
Stop giving me the runaround

592
00:28:39,440 --> 00:28:40,880
and send me your address

593
00:28:41,070 --> 00:28:42,750
in a voice message.

594
00:28:43,000 --> 00:28:44,110
Every last detail!

595
00:28:44,110 --> 00:28:44,960
Quit yapping

596
00:28:44,960 --> 00:28:45,590
and just ship me my suitcase!

597
00:28:45,590 --> 00:28:46,240
Hurry up,

598
00:28:46,240 --> 00:28:46,960
get a move on,

599
00:28:46,960 --> 00:28:47,720
send it to me quickly, efficiently,

600
00:28:47,720 --> 00:28:50,250
and without any fuss!
I'll be there tomorrow!

601
00:28:50,640 --> 00:28:53,700
I really had to get tough with you
to make you cooperate.

602
00:29:03,590 --> 00:29:04,400
All set.

603
00:29:04,880 --> 00:29:06,210
How much did you pay him?

604
00:29:07,070 --> 00:29:08,750
We're buddies. No need to pay.

605
00:29:09,510 --> 00:29:11,270
That's not appropriate, right?

606
00:29:11,270 --> 00:29:13,130
Nothing inappropriate about it.

607
00:29:14,240 --> 00:29:15,270
What's the exact address

608
00:29:15,270 --> 00:29:16,400
of this guesthouse?

609
00:29:17,480 --> 00:29:18,940
I'll text it to you in a bit.

610
00:29:29,350 --> 00:29:31,150
Alright, alright, take a break.

611
00:29:31,880 --> 00:29:33,080
Don't you feel tired?

612
00:29:33,270 --> 00:29:34,070
I do.

613
00:29:34,200 --> 00:29:35,030
Of course you do.

614
00:29:35,030 --> 00:29:36,680
You're using the wrong muscles.

615
00:29:36,680 --> 00:29:37,540
Watch closely.

616
00:29:39,550 --> 00:29:40,680
You should be putting the force

617
00:29:40,680 --> 00:29:42,270
into your shoulders, right?

618
00:29:42,270 --> 00:29:42,960
Look.

619
00:29:43,680 --> 00:29:44,510
Let the force

620
00:29:44,510 --> 00:29:45,440
flow through your shoulders.

621
00:29:45,440 --> 00:29:46,750
See that? See that?

622
00:29:47,160 --> 00:29:49,310
We're giving a massage,
not wrestling someone down,

623
00:29:49,310 --> 00:29:49,750
right?

624
00:29:49,750 --> 00:29:51,400
This way, you won't tire yourself out,

625
00:29:51,400 --> 00:29:52,750
and he'll feel better too. Got it?

626
00:29:52,750 --> 00:29:53,400
Give it a try.

627
00:29:53,400 --> 00:29:53,920
Okay.

628
00:29:54,200 --> 00:29:54,880
Right.

629
00:29:55,750 --> 00:29:57,150
Through your shoulders.

630
00:29:57,790 --> 00:29:59,390
That's right. That's right.

631
00:29:59,400 --> 00:30:01,240
Did you skip breakfast this morning?

632
00:30:01,240 --> 00:30:02,110
No, I ate.

633
00:30:03,200 --> 00:30:05,000
Then put some muscle into it.

634
00:30:05,000 --> 00:30:06,550
You're here so I can practice on you.

635
00:30:06,550 --> 00:30:07,920
You're just a prop, got it?

636
00:30:07,920 --> 00:30:09,780
Props don't get to give opinions.

637
00:30:12,200 --> 00:30:13,240
You two are something else.

638
00:30:13,240 --> 00:30:15,300
Alright, take your time practicing.

639
00:30:15,720 --> 00:30:17,180
Can I just go to sleep then?

640
00:30:17,680 --> 00:30:20,400
You dragged me over here
first thing in the morning.

641
00:30:20,400 --> 00:30:21,550
I'm so sleepy.

642
00:30:21,550 --> 00:30:22,310
If you fall asleep,

643
00:30:22,310 --> 00:30:24,070
how will you know
if my technique is any good?

644
00:30:24,070 --> 00:30:26,590
Falling asleep is how you know
your technique is good, okay?

645
00:30:26,590 --> 00:30:28,450
It means I'm comfortable. Get it?

646
00:30:28,750 --> 00:30:29,270
Dad.

647
00:30:29,270 --> 00:30:30,070
Sweetie.

648
00:30:30,160 --> 00:30:30,960
You've had your breakfast?

649
00:30:30,960 --> 00:30:32,310
Yes, and I brought this for you.

650
00:30:32,310 --> 00:30:33,880
You even brought me something?

651
00:30:33,880 --> 00:30:36,210
I'll show you what real strength is later.

652
00:30:38,480 --> 00:30:39,720
I'll get to work then.

653
00:30:41,960 --> 00:30:43,350
Having guests so early?

654
00:30:44,400 --> 00:30:45,000
Just my buddy,

655
00:30:45,000 --> 00:30:46,400
here to help me practice.

656
00:30:48,510 --> 00:30:49,310
Your friend

657
00:30:49,310 --> 00:30:51,000
has a pretty nice voice.

658
00:30:51,680 --> 00:30:52,480
Really?

659
00:30:54,110 --> 00:30:54,790
I'm off.

660
00:30:57,240 --> 00:30:58,070
Who's that?

661
00:30:59,200 --> 00:31:00,310
Gong's daughter.

662
00:31:02,200 --> 00:31:03,510
Is she blind?

663
00:31:03,680 --> 00:31:04,680
What kind of question is that?

664
00:31:04,680 --> 00:31:05,400
It's a blind massage parlor.

665
00:31:05,400 --> 00:31:06,660
Of course she's blind.

666
00:31:06,960 --> 00:31:08,270
She's quite pretty.

667
00:31:11,830 --> 00:31:12,960
You were lying here the whole time.

668
00:31:12,960 --> 00:31:13,920
How could you tell

669
00:31:13,920 --> 00:31:15,070
whether she's pretty or not?

670
00:31:15,070 --> 00:31:16,720
All I had to do was look up.

671
00:31:16,920 --> 00:31:18,240
I've got a sharp eye.

672
00:31:18,960 --> 00:31:20,070
Oh, you do, huh?

673
00:31:20,590 --> 00:31:21,310
Whoosh!

674
00:31:21,400 --> 00:31:22,310
I'm really getting in.

675
00:31:22,310 --> 00:31:23,400
I'm really getting in there now.

676
00:31:23,400 --> 00:31:24,400
Am I getting in there?

677
00:31:24,400 --> 00:31:25,480
You tell me.

678
00:31:26,790 --> 00:31:27,480
Easy, okay?

679
00:31:27,480 --> 00:31:30,000
What's gotten into you all of a sudden?
You went from 0 to 100 just like that.

680
00:31:30,000 --> 00:31:31,200
Feeling relaxed now?

681
00:31:32,070 --> 00:31:33,730
I really fell asleep in there.

682
00:31:33,920 --> 00:31:34,720
It worked.

683
00:31:37,720 --> 00:31:39,310
The New Year's coming up soon.

684
00:31:39,310 --> 00:31:40,270
How are you planning to spend it?

685
00:31:40,270 --> 00:31:41,880
I usually spend it at home.

686
00:31:42,240 --> 00:31:44,270
But now that my mother's passed away,

687
00:31:44,270 --> 00:31:45,590
I'll just spend it alone.

688
00:31:45,590 --> 00:31:46,750
Don't you still have your brother?

689
00:31:46,750 --> 00:31:47,950
Don't get me started.

690
00:31:47,960 --> 00:31:49,360
He went back to the South.

691
00:31:50,070 --> 00:31:51,000
When was that?

692
00:31:51,830 --> 00:31:52,960
A couple of days ago.

693
00:31:57,350 --> 00:31:59,030
Then let's spend the New Year
together this year.

694
00:31:59,030 --> 00:32:00,630
You can come over to my place.

695
00:32:02,310 --> 00:32:03,440
I think I'll pass.

696
00:32:03,680 --> 00:32:04,240
To be honest with you,

697
00:32:04,240 --> 00:32:06,040
Director Duan kind of scares me.

698
00:32:08,070 --> 00:32:08,880
Alright.

699
00:32:09,400 --> 00:32:10,830
Go on ahead. I won't see you out.

700
00:32:10,830 --> 00:32:11,550
Bye-bye.

701
00:32:18,400 --> 00:32:20,030
What are you still hanging around for?

702
00:32:20,030 --> 00:32:21,720
Waiting to lay an egg or something?

703
00:32:21,720 --> 00:32:22,350
No.

704
00:32:23,400 --> 00:32:24,200
It's just...

705
00:32:25,720 --> 00:32:26,850
Is something wrong?

706
00:32:33,830 --> 00:32:35,200
I got fired from my job.

707
00:32:35,640 --> 00:32:36,440
Why?

708
00:32:36,590 --> 00:32:38,450
They changed the name of the place

709
00:32:38,480 --> 00:32:41,240
and started passing off
heated recirculated water

710
00:32:41,240 --> 00:32:42,370
as hot spring water.

711
00:32:42,680 --> 00:32:43,680
It pissed me off,

712
00:32:43,720 --> 00:32:45,000
so I went public with it

713
00:32:45,000 --> 00:32:46,200
and told the customers.

714
00:32:46,200 --> 00:32:47,860
In the end, the boss found out.

715
00:32:48,750 --> 00:32:51,010
With the New Year just around the corner,

716
00:32:52,030 --> 00:32:52,960
could you

717
00:32:52,960 --> 00:32:54,440
lend me 2,000 yuan

718
00:32:54,640 --> 00:32:56,570
to tide me over? Would that be okay?

719
00:33:00,070 --> 00:33:02,070
I really can't come up with
2,000 yuan right now.

720
00:33:02,070 --> 00:33:02,790
Then... Then never mind.

721
00:33:02,790 --> 00:33:03,960
You know, it's because

722
00:33:03,960 --> 00:33:06,490
my mom's savings are
in a fixed-term account.

723
00:33:06,880 --> 00:33:08,030
Wait until I finish this month's work,

724
00:33:08,030 --> 00:33:08,960
okay? I'll lend you the money.

725
00:33:08,960 --> 00:33:10,400
No, it's okay. Forget it.

726
00:33:10,400 --> 00:33:11,590
I'll go ask Gong

727
00:33:11,720 --> 00:33:13,160
if I can get an advance.

728
00:33:13,200 --> 00:33:14,310
I'll just get an advance
a-and transfer it to you

729
00:33:14,310 --> 00:33:15,480
so you can use it for now, okay?

730
00:33:15,480 --> 00:33:16,160
That wouldn't be right.

731
00:33:16,160 --> 00:33:17,590
You're working for him now,

732
00:33:17,590 --> 00:33:19,310
and you just started.
I don't want him getting the wrong idea.

733
00:33:19,310 --> 00:33:19,960
Don't worry.

734
00:33:19,960 --> 00:33:20,920
I've got plenty of buddies.

735
00:33:20,920 --> 00:33:22,510
I'll just borrow some from one of them.

736
00:33:22,510 --> 00:33:23,440
It's no big deal.

737
00:33:24,440 --> 00:33:25,160
I'm off.

738
00:33:25,350 --> 00:33:26,070
Are you sure?

739
00:33:26,070 --> 00:33:26,960
Don't worry.

740
00:33:42,110 --> 00:33:43,310
I can lend it to you.

741
00:33:49,880 --> 00:33:51,270
Are you talking to me?

742
00:33:51,440 --> 00:33:52,240
Yes.

743
00:33:52,720 --> 00:33:54,520
Didn't you want to borrow money?

744
00:33:55,240 --> 00:33:56,720
My eyesight may be bad,

745
00:33:56,830 --> 00:33:58,360
but my hearing's just fine.

746
00:33:58,630 --> 00:34:04,290
[Please Come Again]

747
00:34:00,680 --> 00:34:02,640
We just met.

748
00:34:02,920 --> 00:34:04,920
Why are you willing to lend me money?

749
00:34:06,590 --> 00:34:07,550
There's a catch.

750
00:34:13,219 --> 00:34:16,610
[New Year's Eve] [Happy New Year]

751
00:34:25,550 --> 00:34:26,360
Bro,

752
00:34:26,880 --> 00:34:28,230
who exactly are we waiting for?

753
00:34:28,130 --> 00:34:31,389
[New Year's Eve Dinner] [Make Reservations for
the Spring Festival Reunion Banquet]

754
00:34:28,550 --> 00:34:30,030
An irrelevant person.

755
00:34:31,800 --> 00:34:32,880
If they're irrelevant,

756
00:34:32,880 --> 00:34:34,139
why wait for them then?

757
00:34:41,880 --> 00:34:42,670
Hello.

758
00:34:42,020 --> 00:34:44,020
[Mr. Zhou Peiyu]

759
00:34:42,030 --> 00:34:49,360
[New Year's Eve Dinner] [Make Reservations for
the Spring Festival Reunion Banquet]

760
00:34:43,030 --> 00:34:43,960
I have a question.

761
00:34:43,960 --> 00:34:45,030
Can I buy a train ticket

762
00:34:45,030 --> 00:34:46,550
for someone

763
00:34:46,550 --> 00:34:48,280
if I don't know their ID number?

764
00:34:49,920 --> 00:34:51,320
Of course not.

765
00:34:51,670 --> 00:34:52,760
Without an ID,

766
00:34:52,960 --> 00:34:54,159
you can't buy a ticket

767
00:34:54,190 --> 00:34:56,110
at any train station in our country.

768
00:34:56,110 --> 00:34:56,920
Thanks.

769
00:35:03,440 --> 00:35:05,100
Who are we buying a ticket for?

770
00:35:05,400 --> 00:35:07,260
For the person we're waiting for.

771
00:35:07,630 --> 00:35:08,440
But isn't the person

772
00:35:08,440 --> 00:35:10,190
we're waiting for arriving soon?

773
00:35:10,190 --> 00:35:12,030
Yes. I want to buy her a train ticket

774
00:35:12,030 --> 00:35:13,670
so she can go back to her hometown
as soon as possible.

775
00:35:13,670 --> 00:35:16,230
Sending someone back
right after they arrive—

776
00:35:16,230 --> 00:35:18,160
do you owe them money or something?

777
00:35:18,670 --> 00:35:20,530
Why do you have so many questions?

778
00:35:23,200 --> 00:35:23,610
[Food]

779
00:35:23,680 --> 00:35:24,690
[Thirteen-Spice Crawfish]

780
00:35:24,820 --> 00:35:26,140
[Classic Tasting Combo:
Spicy & Thirteen-Spice]

781
00:35:31,090 --> 00:35:35,030
[Exit]

782
00:35:39,110 --> 00:35:39,920
Here I am!

783
00:35:48,440 --> 00:35:50,500
I didn't expect you to come pick me up.

784
00:35:54,110 --> 00:35:54,800
Give me the suitcase,

785
00:35:54,800 --> 00:35:55,590
and you can head back.

786
00:35:55,590 --> 00:35:56,280
W-W-What?

787
00:35:56,510 --> 00:35:57,440
W-Wait a minute.

788
00:35:59,150 --> 00:36:00,810
Are you trying to get rid of me?

789
00:36:02,630 --> 00:36:04,030
You've been down south for a few days,

790
00:36:04,030 --> 00:36:05,440
and it's gone to your head, huh?

791
00:36:05,440 --> 00:36:06,760
Am I a delivery guy now?

792
00:36:07,000 --> 00:36:09,400
Just here to drop off
your luggage and bags?

793
00:36:09,800 --> 00:36:10,320
Don't take it then.

794
00:36:10,320 --> 00:36:12,480
Don't shower
or change your clothes, either.

795
00:36:12,480 --> 00:36:14,010
You're just unbelievable.

796
00:36:14,150 --> 00:36:14,880
Didn't you have something

797
00:36:14,880 --> 00:36:16,190
to say to me in person?

798
00:36:16,400 --> 00:36:18,000
Spit it out so you can go home.

799
00:36:18,400 --> 00:36:19,190
I do have something to say,

800
00:36:19,190 --> 00:36:20,030
but how can I say it here?

801
00:36:20,030 --> 00:36:21,480
Why can't you say it here?

802
00:36:21,710 --> 00:36:22,880
Since when do we need a special place
to talk?

803
00:36:22,880 --> 00:36:24,000
Of course we do.

804
00:36:24,480 --> 00:36:27,080
Would you propose to someone
at a funeral home?

805
00:36:27,400 --> 00:36:28,710
What, am I wrong?

806
00:36:30,030 --> 00:36:31,400
What a buzzkill.

807
00:36:32,710 --> 00:36:33,770
Welcome. Welcome.

808
00:36:34,000 --> 00:36:34,710
Sis.

809
00:36:35,190 --> 00:36:37,510
Well, is this your first time in Bengbu?

810
00:36:37,840 --> 00:36:39,280
Yes, and you are?

811
00:36:39,710 --> 00:36:40,510
I...

812
00:36:41,670 --> 00:36:44,280
I'm Zhengliang's underling, Zhou Zheng!

813
00:36:45,230 --> 00:36:46,880
Zhou Zheng as in handsome.

814
00:36:51,510 --> 00:36:52,920
J-Just call me Pink Hair.

815
00:36:53,670 --> 00:36:55,150
Is "Pink Hair" even a name?

816
00:36:56,070 --> 00:36:57,550
I-I thought it was your zodiac year.

817
00:36:57,550 --> 00:36:58,590
My name is Ai Chen.

818
00:36:58,590 --> 00:36:59,480
Ai as in moxibustion,

819
00:36:59,480 --> 00:37:00,840
Chen as in birth time.

820
00:37:01,510 --> 00:37:03,030
Nice to meet you.

821
00:37:03,070 --> 00:37:04,200
Nice to meet you too.

822
00:37:04,590 --> 00:37:05,000
Here,

823
00:37:05,000 --> 00:37:05,920
let me help you with that luggage.

824
00:37:05,920 --> 00:37:08,050
T-This isn't mine. It's your buddy's.

825
00:37:08,150 --> 00:37:09,280
He's not my buddy,

826
00:37:09,320 --> 00:37:10,280
nor is he yours.

827
00:37:13,320 --> 00:37:15,000
Always talking nonsense like that.

828
00:37:15,000 --> 00:37:15,800
What an attitude.

829
00:37:15,800 --> 00:37:16,800
Sis, where's your luggage?

830
00:37:16,800 --> 00:37:17,960
I don't have any luggage.

831
00:37:17,960 --> 00:37:19,320
T-This is all his.

832
00:37:19,670 --> 00:37:21,400
You came from the Northeast
without any luggage?

833
00:37:21,400 --> 00:37:22,480
Exactly.

834
00:37:22,710 --> 00:37:24,230
I was in a rush.

835
00:37:24,360 --> 00:37:25,320
I just arrived in Fuzhou

836
00:37:25,320 --> 00:37:27,230
from Fucheng yesterday.

837
00:37:27,550 --> 00:37:28,110
And today,

838
00:37:28,110 --> 00:37:29,280
I hurried over here.

839
00:37:30,070 --> 00:37:32,280
It's fine. I'll just buy whatever I need.

840
00:37:32,280 --> 00:37:33,410
Sis, you're so cool.

841
00:37:34,280 --> 00:37:36,740
Let me treat you
to some Bengbu specialties.

842
00:37:36,800 --> 00:37:38,440
I just bought a group voucher.

843
00:37:38,440 --> 00:37:39,280
It's a great deal.

844
00:37:39,280 --> 00:37:40,760
I'm starving, you know?

845
00:37:40,760 --> 00:37:42,320
I was on the road for 7 hours

846
00:37:42,320 --> 00:37:43,400
and didn't eat anything.

847
00:37:43,400 --> 00:37:44,320
Perfect timing then.

848
00:37:44,320 --> 00:37:45,280
I disagree.

849
00:37:46,590 --> 00:37:47,920
Alright, bro. Then we're going alone.

850
00:37:47,920 --> 00:37:50,320
Who asked him?
Like we need his permission.

851
00:37:55,440 --> 00:37:56,280
It's so flavorful.

852
00:37:56,230 --> 00:38:04,750
[Culinary Delights Along the Huai River]
[Street Food Stalls and Vibrant Life]

853
00:37:57,800 --> 00:37:58,360
Isn't it?

854
00:37:58,480 --> 00:37:59,320
So tasty.

855
00:38:02,440 --> 00:38:03,230
Sis,

856
00:38:04,230 --> 00:38:05,230
you're so pretty.

857
00:38:06,880 --> 00:38:08,410
You're such a sweet talker.

858
00:38:09,670 --> 00:38:11,630
I should be the one treating this time.

859
00:38:11,630 --> 00:38:13,960
He already bought the voucher on Meituan.

860
00:38:14,590 --> 00:38:16,550
Then I'll treat next time.

861
00:38:17,920 --> 00:38:18,630
Sis,

862
00:38:21,590 --> 00:38:23,120
be my girlfriend, will you?

863
00:38:27,320 --> 00:38:28,440
You're a bit too young.

864
00:38:28,440 --> 00:38:29,670
We've got a huge age gap.

865
00:38:29,670 --> 00:38:30,960
What era are we in?

866
00:38:32,070 --> 00:38:33,600
Age is not an issue anymore.

867
00:38:33,880 --> 00:38:34,800
That's true.

868
00:38:36,440 --> 00:38:37,230
But

869
00:38:37,230 --> 00:38:39,290
I've already fallen for Zhengliang.

870
00:38:43,110 --> 00:38:44,190
I knew it.

871
00:38:45,760 --> 00:38:46,510
I could tell.

872
00:38:46,760 --> 00:38:49,030
Are you two dating?

873
00:38:49,510 --> 00:38:51,230
No. He hasn't agreed to it yet.

874
00:38:51,800 --> 00:38:52,550
Wait, bro.

875
00:38:52,760 --> 00:38:54,230
Y-You haven't agreed?

876
00:38:54,230 --> 00:38:55,000
Exactly.

877
00:38:55,000 --> 00:38:56,800
He's got a psychological issue.

878
00:38:58,760 --> 00:38:59,920
Am I wrong?

879
00:39:01,280 --> 00:39:06,150
[Culinary Delights Along the Huai River]
[Street Food Stalls and Vibrant Life]

880
00:39:05,800 --> 00:39:06,550
I get it.

881
00:39:07,320 --> 00:39:08,590
Well, bro.

882
00:39:09,510 --> 00:39:11,710
Don't worry, ED is treatable nowadays.

883
00:39:13,360 --> 00:39:15,160
Want me to knock your lights out?

884
00:39:17,000 --> 00:39:19,600
No, no, no.
That's not the kind of issue I meant.

885
00:39:20,070 --> 00:39:21,550
He... His issue's even more serious
than that?

886
00:39:21,550 --> 00:39:22,360
I'll go check

887
00:39:22,440 --> 00:39:24,360
why the drinks from our combo
aren't here yet.

888
00:39:24,360 --> 00:39:25,550
He got embarrassed.

889
00:39:27,110 --> 00:39:27,840
What,

890
00:39:27,840 --> 00:39:29,070
it's even m-more serious than that?

891
00:39:29,070 --> 00:39:30,110
Stop guessing.

892
00:39:30,670 --> 00:39:32,510
Well, that's his privacy.

893
00:39:32,800 --> 00:39:34,000
Let him tell you himself later,

894
00:39:34,000 --> 00:39:34,550
okay?

895
00:39:39,280 --> 00:39:40,340
Look how much I ate.

896
00:39:41,280 --> 00:39:42,150
So delicious.

897
00:39:45,840 --> 00:39:47,590
Zhengliang's quite weird.

898
00:39:48,590 --> 00:39:49,360
I-I can do it myself.

899
00:39:49,360 --> 00:39:50,150
Thanks.

900
00:39:50,670 --> 00:39:51,510
I heard

901
00:39:51,630 --> 00:39:53,000
he has a younger brother in the Northeast.

902
00:39:53,000 --> 00:39:54,600
You mean Zhengguang, right?

903
00:39:55,070 --> 00:39:56,150
These two brothers

904
00:39:57,280 --> 00:39:59,630
don't get along well
in terms of personality,

905
00:39:59,630 --> 00:40:00,830
so they always fight.

906
00:40:02,000 --> 00:40:03,960
Then does Zhengliang have any friends?

907
00:40:03,960 --> 00:40:04,960
Of course he does.

908
00:40:06,550 --> 00:40:08,150
Although he's a bit avoidant,

909
00:40:08,150 --> 00:40:09,360
he's quite reliable.

910
00:40:09,400 --> 00:40:11,130
He still has a few good friends.

911
00:40:12,440 --> 00:40:13,400
Don't drink alone.

912
00:40:13,400 --> 00:40:14,660
Let's drink together.

913
00:40:18,880 --> 00:40:19,670
Sis, well...

914
00:40:20,070 --> 00:40:21,150
You eat first.

915
00:40:21,190 --> 00:40:22,150
I ran into an acquaintance.

916
00:40:22,150 --> 00:40:22,760
I'll go say hi.

917
00:40:22,760 --> 00:40:23,510
Go ahead.

918
00:40:23,510 --> 00:40:25,440
Don't mind me. It's okay. Go ahead.

919
00:40:31,550 --> 00:40:32,360
Ms. Xia?

920
00:40:33,920 --> 00:40:34,710
Ms. Xia.

921
00:40:35,960 --> 00:40:36,760
Zhou Zheng?

922
00:40:38,880 --> 00:40:40,320
How did you turn out like this?

923
00:40:40,320 --> 00:40:41,800
D-Don't I look

924
00:40:41,960 --> 00:40:44,070
way more handsome than I did
back in school?

925
00:40:44,070 --> 00:40:46,400
I thought you'd gone back
to repeat a year.

926
00:40:46,670 --> 00:40:47,800
I never expected...

927
00:40:48,190 --> 00:40:50,520
Isn't the point of studying to make money?

928
00:40:51,150 --> 00:40:53,750
And isn't the point of making money
to be happy?

929
00:40:53,840 --> 00:40:54,630
You know,

930
00:40:54,960 --> 00:40:56,760
you can't put a price on
doing what you want.

931
00:40:56,760 --> 00:40:57,710
As long as I'm happy...

932
00:40:57,710 --> 00:40:58,360
What's going on?

933
00:40:58,360 --> 00:40:59,150
Isn't that like

934
00:40:59,150 --> 00:40:59,840
I'm getting a head start on making money?

935
00:40:59,840 --> 00:41:00,760
I heard him call her "teacher".

936
00:41:00,760 --> 00:41:02,510
Who did you learn all this from?

937
00:41:03,590 --> 00:41:04,800
From you.

938
00:41:05,320 --> 00:41:06,380
You taught me that.

939
00:41:06,550 --> 00:41:08,080
You pushed me into society,

940
00:41:08,510 --> 00:41:09,960
and society taught me that,

941
00:41:09,960 --> 00:41:10,590
right?

942
00:41:13,550 --> 00:41:14,760
Ms. Xia, well,

943
00:41:15,550 --> 00:41:16,760
enjoy your meal.

944
00:41:16,760 --> 00:41:18,000
This meal is on me.

945
00:41:19,000 --> 00:41:19,920
Enjoy your meal.

946
00:41:19,920 --> 00:41:20,960
Alright, alright.

947
00:41:20,960 --> 00:41:22,820
He's really thrown his life away.

948
00:41:41,190 --> 00:41:42,000
Ms. Xia.

949
00:41:42,110 --> 00:41:43,280
W-What did you just say?

950
00:41:43,280 --> 00:41:44,680
I-I didn't hear clearly.

951
00:41:45,360 --> 00:41:46,630
S-Say it again.

952
00:41:47,880 --> 00:41:49,150
Sorry. Sorry.

953
00:41:49,630 --> 00:41:50,800
Sit down.

954
00:41:50,960 --> 00:41:51,960
Say it again.

955
00:42:14,630 --> 00:42:15,890
That was your teacher?

956
00:42:16,000 --> 00:42:17,800
Yeah, my former homeroom teacher.

957
00:42:17,800 --> 00:42:19,200
Totally irresponsible.

958
00:42:21,070 --> 00:42:21,880
Is that so?

959
00:42:23,960 --> 00:42:24,590
You don't necessarily have to go to school

960
00:42:24,590 --> 00:42:25,800
to get ahead in life,

961
00:42:27,440 --> 00:42:28,240
but education

962
00:42:28,440 --> 00:42:30,040
is definitely the best path.

963
00:42:32,470 --> 00:42:33,280
Sure.

964
00:42:35,150 --> 00:42:36,750
For ordinary people, maybe.

965
00:42:38,710 --> 00:42:39,670
But who am I?

966
00:42:42,760 --> 00:42:45,000
I'm the chosen one.

967
00:42:46,230 --> 00:42:47,030
Right?

968
00:42:47,840 --> 00:42:48,670
Right?

969
00:42:48,920 --> 00:42:49,840
The chosen one!

970
00:42:50,480 --> 00:42:53,000
Well, sis, bro,

971
00:42:53,400 --> 00:42:56,000
you wouldn't happen to

972
00:42:56,000 --> 00:42:58,000
look down on me
for not graduating high school, right?

973
00:42:58,000 --> 00:42:59,110
How could I?

974
00:42:59,880 --> 00:43:01,360
I actually look up to you.

975
00:43:02,190 --> 00:43:03,670
I didn't even graduate elementary school.

976
00:43:03,670 --> 00:43:05,150
I couldn't tell.

977
00:43:06,280 --> 00:43:07,710
I don't hit people in the face, right?

978
00:43:07,710 --> 00:43:08,360
Yes.

979
00:43:08,400 --> 00:43:09,400
Well, Doctor,

980
00:43:10,030 --> 00:43:10,800
here's to education!

981
00:43:10,800 --> 00:43:12,630
To education! Come on, cheers!
